(FIL-01: a file handle's size, descriptor, readable, writable and permissions properties report the documented values, and readable/writable track the open MODE.
 Also covers: FIL-02, FIL-03, FIL-04, FIL-07, FIL-38, FIL-39, FIL-40.
 permissions prints 420, which IS octal 0644 - the property returns the
 raw mode bits as a Number and Print renders a Number in decimal.
 readable/writable answering per-mode is vox bug #37 fixed, confirmed here.
 Run from the vox-fuzz worktree root; the probe creates everything it
 needs under vf_scratch/files/ and touches nothing else.
